Figure 10 — Real testbed validation flow (state diagram of access):
  Step 1: UE to Server, 5G ON / SDP OFF -> access FAILS (site unreachable)
  Step 2: UPF iptables (SDP OFF) -> only ZT manager IP (192.168.0.12)
          reachable, all else DROP
  Step 3: UE runs SDP IH client -> authenticates with ZT manager (SDP
